   "question": "Show usage data indicating that the changes are useful before changing the API",
   "quote": "Before changing our API, it'd be good to atleast show some usage that indicates that the changes here are useful. I assume you've already been running this locally, and collecting the data, so it'd be good to know what it turned up?",
