    "at": "2025-01-17",
    "by": "vasild",
    "id": "c:2598764171",
    "quote": "Yes, I have been running this locally - there is like 65x difference between the least and most demanding peers."
   },
   "status_note": "author shared local testing results showing 65x difference between peers",
